  "description": "Pairs Kronikol.Extensions.ClickHouse with ClickHouse.Driver, the official ClickHouse .NET client (HTTP). Adds compile-time driver integration: accurate rows-affected counts for INSERTs (read from the driver's QueryStats, populated from the X-ClickHouse-Summary response header — its ExecuteNonQuery return value is always 0 for INSERTs) plus typed wrap/DI registration helpers. Also tracks the driver's IClickHouseClient (InsertBinaryAsync drawn as one INSERT with its rows) and IClickHouseDataSource.GetClient(), wrapped or decorated through DI.",
